  "description": "The Belami 10 brings a slim, modern look to everyday urban riding. Its clean alloy frame integrates the Bosch rear hub drive unit and compact 360Wh battery for a smooth, light-feeling ride through city streets. With 75mm of front suspension to smooth the ride over rough patches, the bike stays comfortable and controlled on varied surfaces.\n\nA Shimano Cues 9-speed drivetrain handles daily routes with ease, while hydraulic disc brakes deliver consistent stopping power. Practical features like a Racktime rear carrier, full Metasol fenders, an Ursus kickstand and bright front and rear lights make city commuting simple and dependable. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires deliver strong puncture protection and dependable traction for everyday urban travel.",
